>> title: Arrabbiata Sauce
>> category: Sauces & Gravies
>> tags: tomato, spicy, pasta, vegetarian, stovetop
>> counters: Pizzeria
>> aka: penne all'arrabbiata, arrabiata, spicy tomato sauce
>> servings: 4
>> time: 40 min

>> step: sizzle 2 min
Sizzle @garlic{5%cloves}(thinly sliced) with @red pepper flakes{1 1/2%tsp} in @extra-virgin olive oil{1/3%cup}(80 mL) over medium heat for ~{2%min}.

>> step: fry 1 min
Fry @tomato paste{1%Tbs} into @&(~1)chili oil{} for ~{1%min}.

>> step: simmer 25 min
Simmer @&(~1)base{} with @whole peeled tomatoes{28%oz}(800 g; crushed by hand) and @kosher salt{1%tsp} for ~{25%min}.

>> step: finish off heat
Finish @&(~1)sauce{} off the heat with @grated Pecorino Romano{1/4%cup}(25 g) and @flat-leaf parsley{2%Tbs}(chopped).
